---
description: Pilcrow theme conventions
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root before editing. It maps each change to the file that owns it,
lists what not to do, and sets the theme conventions. Follow it as written.

After any change, run `pnpm check && pnpm build`. For visual changes, also check the page at 360px and desktop, light and dark.
Task walkthroughs (new post, new section, new color preset) are in `.claude/skills/*/SKILL.md`.
